OL,3,AForeign defence contractors will need
OL,4,Ato invest in UK under new rules
OL,5,
OL,6,FForeign firms awarded large defence
OL,7,Fcontracts will need to invest an equal
OL,8,Fvalue back into the UK to create "bang
OL,9,Ffor the British buck", Defence
OL,10,FSecretary Wes Streeting has announced.
OL,12,FUnder the new rules, companies
OL,13,Freceiving more than #50m will need to
OL,14,Fspend an equivalent amount on British
OL,15,Ffactories, jobs and training.
OL,17,FIt comes as the government continues to
OL,18,Fface pressure to hit its target of
OL,19,Fspending 3% of GDP on defence by 2030,
OL,20,Fan objective some opposition MPs and
OL,21,Fdefence analysts have questioned its
OL,22,Fability to deliver.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
