OL,3,AForeign defence contractors will need
OL,4,Ato invest in UK under new rules
OL,5,
OL,6,FStreeting told BBC Breakfast the new
OL,7,Frules would help achieve this target
OL,8,Fgiven it "does come at a cost to the
OL,9,Fcountry and other things we'd like to
OL,10,Fspend money on".
